        <body>
            <div xml:id="d320">

                <pb facs="1583" n="1432" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v07-09mSupp/pg1432"/>

                <head>320. Memorandum from Dillon to President Kennedy, April 5<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d320-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline>
                        <date ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-head" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1963-04-05">April 5, 1963</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d320-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d320-1"/>
                <p>As Chairman of the Cabinet Committee on Balance of Payments, I am forwarding
                    herewith the Committee’s report on its re-examination of the balance of payments
                    problem in response to your memorandum of March 2. As you know, the Committee is
                    expecting to meet with you and discuss this report at 6:00 P.M. on Tuesday,
                    April 9.</p>
                <closer><signed>Douglas Dillon</signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d320-a1.xml" xpointer="d320-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d320-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d320-f1-content">
                <p>Forwards report by Cabinet Committee on Balance of Payments. Prospects and
                    solutions. Secret. 6 pp. Kennedy Library, President’s Office Files, Treasury,
                    Balance of Payments, JFK Reading, 4/17/93, Box 94E.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
